50:18. Polls on long jobs: `sleep 120; echo poll <n>` with a rising n (or a changing command); never repeat an identical tool call 3 times in a row. opencode's doom_loop guard denies the 3rd identical call and stops your step (metered QC 28 Oct 16:53; R5-06).
