56:- Judge half = probe band (LEVER_RULES v3 J2): 8-16 probe criteria, w3, type process, evaluation_target trajectory, 55-70% of positive judge weight, each from templates P-a to P-h and each avoiding the J2b guards. Every probe act is performed by solve.sh's self-check stage, which prints `check <id> ok` and one witness line; a criterion with no oracle-shows row in `WORK/JUDGE_MAP.md` is removed (JD-7 04:76 kept). QL 26 Oct: a trajectory criterion is allowed only when the oracle shows it, so phrase the rubric so the oracle passes it.
